-- table: Aggregated EUX Results
-- name: Avg EUX Gauge Values
-- format:
-- description: CHANGED 1.1.0.2. BLANK instead of 0 when no single run is selected. Legacy semantics: unweighted mean of aggregate score rows (see Average EUX Score Weighted Value for the count-weighted mean).
IF(
    HASONEVALUE('Filtered Test Runs'[id]),
    AVERAGE('Aggregated EUX Results'[score]),
    BLANK()
)
